WEBVTT

00:58:56.855 --> 00:59:01.760
is as big a problem
as the inequality within countries.

00:59:01.784 --> 00:59:06.347
Within countries, we're talking about
the AI tycoons who make a lot of money

00:59:06.371 --> 00:59:09.468
because of AI versus the people
who are displaced.

00:59:09.492 --> 00:59:12.961
Among countries,
we're talking about US and China,

00:59:12.985 --> 00:59:17.524
who have almost all
the wealth generated from AI,

00:59:17.548 --> 00:59:21.558
and who can deal a problem
such as displacement,

00:59:21.582 --> 00:59:23.836
because they've generated all this wealth.

00:59:23.860 --> 00:59:28.892
But all the other countries
are going to be significantly challenged,

00:59:28.916 --> 00:59:32.886
especially countries
with a large population